  _title: "\u201CHavenous Tree Bark\u201C"
  _description: "The trees from the south-half of the forest are Havenwood Trees,
    with really thick \u201Cskins\u201D, probably developed because of all the monsters
    around. Although it makes it easy to strip down from its bark, they\u2019re very
    hard to cut, and thus live very old."
